            "review_title": "Review at Sik Gaek Korean Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Emmanuel S\nHanoi, Vietnam917 contributions\n0\nBEST Korean Restaurant in Hanoi...... hands down !!!\nApr 2021\nBeing an active Restaurant reviewer in Hanoi, I've been meaning to find an authentic Korean restaurant for a long time.\n\nAnd WOW, did I find this one. The food is INCREDIBLE & AUTHENTIC and the service is even better.\n\nThe owner is probably the MOST hospitable person (and caring) that I've ever seen in a restaurant of that large size. Always checking on customers (welcoming them, checking on whether they enjoyed the food & also when you leave gives you an exit gift).\n\nIt's a bit of a drive, but I STRONGLY suggest you check this spot out, you WON'T be disappointed\n\nTHANK YOU \"Sik Gaek.\" Will definitely be coming back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 30, 2021",
            "rating": 1.0,
